Hint ladder
  Nudge: ask what the code does for the smallest failing input (an empty input, one element, null or undefined).
 Lens: name the lens (for example patterns or edge-cases) and ask which invariant it checks.
 Failing case: show the failing input from the concept chunk without the fixed code.
 Approach: describe the fix in words from the explanation field.
