ts-doublylinkedlist-core-ex1   format: predict-output   level: L0   grading: exact   modes: practice, quiz
Prompt. For const l = new DllBad<number>(); l.pushBack(1); l.pushBack(2); what does l.toArrayReversed().join(",")
